{"c":[{"name":"20261005T044215Z-74ca06dede7d18b3","text":"B28: after a fixture page navigates away, wait for site.waitForLoad of the landed page before the next site.command, or the command goes to the departing page's long poll and times out.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T044215Z-8ef7ae66324e8796","text":"B28: accept.ts cannot run executor.run: it first asks the native reader for watchInput and gets noWindow; check page-link VerbResults in accept and the executor with test/fake-app.ts knobs.","type":"note"}]}
